00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:13.060
Those challenges are the ones
we want to eliminate or reduce.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:16.830
And this is exactly where
Cloud Code comes in.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:21.150
What it gives you is
a set of ID plug-ins

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:24.330
to make the development
loop faster.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:29.520
The idea is to keep developers
in the ID, less distraction,

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:33.240
less context switching, exactly
what we want as developers,

00:03:33.240 --> 00:03:36.020
to stay in the code.

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.300
Most importantly,
there is support

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:41.480
for the full development cycle.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.270
We also want to give
samples and configurations

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:46.040
to get you started fast.

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:49.800
And that is what Cloud
Code provides you with.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:54.930
In short, Cloud Code
is a set of ID plug-ins

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.690
which are available for
a lot of popular IDs,

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:00.870
