and outer development loops.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:19.769
Now it should be clear to
you what Cloud Code does.

00:04:19.769 --> 00:04:23.120
It focuses on the
inner development loop.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:26.450
It's here to make that
whole loop faster and more

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:29.660
